{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0373_1000_p", "source_sha256": "dc17e891b57606f5fdfa485c03f93d869f2397db98fb63ba8575002b3c369578", "ja": "（『EmotionLight』公演まであと数日。準備も\nひと段落したし、少し休憩して、外の空気でも吸おう）", "zh": "（距离《EmotionLight》公演还有几天。准备工作也告一段落了，稍微休息一下，去外面呼吸点新鲜空气吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0373_1001_p", "source_sha256": "de81363b1dc04474f58f8903b01b70f71254a41860deefb708c137752e59c9ed", "ja": "（ん？　あそこにいるのは……）", "zh": "（嗯？在那边的人是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0373_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "daae5c2748dea06bc3dea390f81bc4559abded2d4e82219d10c7ba42354aed3c", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん。\nお疲れさまです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0373_1003_p", "source_sha256": "9b377759e77fa436bf8e2ead03d462f246f127cca85af7fb079e9c7324bbdbc2", "ja": "志保、お疲れさま。\nこんなところで、何をしてたんだ？", "zh": "志保，辛苦了。\n你在这种地方做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0373_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "b977665ed4b3faf7152461394fd12e5c35fe152d90266a81a689925c8fe90e2c", "ja": "少し、考えごとを……。\nこれまでのことを、思い出したりとか。", "zh": "只是在想些事情……\n比如回想一下过去的经历之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0373_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "f7b8fa9d2e482d715d956ff42e772a52129674959b99fb5034e7abc92e5c8c57", "ja": "アイドルになったばかりの頃は、\nひとりだけで頑張ろうとしてたな、とか……。", "zh": "刚成为偶像的时候，我还总想着一个人努力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0373_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "75be57b23d3ebe8b300f27e89e084061677c58dd612d45394f524d36fcade897", "ja": "でも、今は……違うなって。", "zh": "但是，现在……已经不一样了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0373_1007_p", "source_sha256": "89f1761638607bfce00873467e2e02d9b70237ec6e95ed2c6b58b504cc460476", "ja": "ああ……そうだな。", "zh": "啊……是啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0373_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "25448cd7c5e6ab31c335550f2489be8f1e50a83790a09fb126f048c9ad513254", "ja": "私ひとりでは、きっと……できなかったと思います。\nセンター公演も、それ以外のお仕事も。", "zh": "仅凭我一个人，我想肯定是做不到的……\n无论是中心公演，还是其他工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0373_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "1a3897ec37ec605ca845c162dc378dc060a632e0575b15330bbf77ed3974c3e0", "ja": "支えてもらって、感謝してます。", "zh": "承蒙你一直支持我，我很感激。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0373_1010_p", "source_sha256": "28c3807b0d1d2f0700184c9abe379964fc83d496831df2be4d0d3cb2322545c3", "ja": "いや、こっちはサポートをしただけだよ。\n志保の頑張りがあったから、今の志保がいるんだ！", "zh": "不，我只是从旁协助而已。\n正因为志保一直在努力，才会有现在的志保啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0373_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "e4508b6730fd673d26082764ad7371bb4fff505f9e8a3c5f8945c8d10f5719b5", "ja": "……。\n今のは、劇場のみんなの話ですよ？", "zh": "……  \n我说的是剧场里的大家哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0373_1012_p", "source_sha256": "5e8dcb7808d1c1bbe3baeedb8182c22708c5fea211a3688c2693630c6e327b48", "ja": "えっ？　あ……そ、そうか！　はは……！", "zh": "诶？啊……是、是这样啊！哈哈……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0373_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "73116566f31f474ab03b785adb852848202e7d723d488fb60347b21791c8b754", "ja": "今回の公演も、みんなと遅くまでレッスンをしたり、\nお仕事をしたりするのが楽しくて。", "zh": "这次的公演也是，能和大家一起练习到很晚、一起工作，我觉得很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0373_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "71363b9c158bbf4b1b611421367136afc848e7fed7c4120c2900f81de512740b", "ja": "なので、それがもう少しで終わってしまうと思うと、\n少し寂しい気もします。", "zh": "所以，一想到这些马上就要结束了，心里也觉得有些寂寞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0373_1015_p", "source_sha256": "aa5c61d599ad6924fd862129c633dc279132761b67e0ed168d58a0a0e8ce1d4a", "ja": "そうだな……でも、それもきっと、こうやって\n思い出せるような、いい思い出になると思うよ。", "zh": "是啊……不过，我想那也一定会成为今后能这样回想起来的美好回忆吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0373_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "68927359723755cd1f5128bc0933b8dbf7139f961b3244cf7a02e8fa6360c640", "ja": "そうですね。私たちにとっても、\nファンのみなさんにとっても、そうなって欲しいです。", "zh": "是啊。对我们来说，\n对各位粉丝来说，我也希望能成为那样的美好回忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0373_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "a6551a806b6d8bc106335fbf4346c088769b5eed3c0c72847c34a9d11217b99c", "ja": "そのためには、もっと頑張らないと……。\n今から少し、レッスンに付き合ってくれませんか？", "zh": "为此，我还得更加努力才行……  \n现在能陪我练习一会儿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0373_1018_p", "source_sha256": "788cf825a6a124e9934360b7fb322980224bef5166387d4031de9d27456d5455", "ja": "え、今から？　うーん……わかった。\nもう遅いから、少しだけな！", "zh": "诶，现在就要？呃……好吧。\n已经很晚了，只练一会儿哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0373_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "2d6d474f9641ce5ca41ec353980b23a74647e002cb85d8a41e62ee1843bc8e0c", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\nあの……サポート、頼りにしてますから。", "zh": "谢谢您。\n那个……我可是很依赖您的支持的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
